<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/OCE> .
