<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "Ontology for the semantic layer built upon MatInf databases, currently in use for the CRC 1625." .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-03-19"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ontology for the semantic layer built upon MatInf databases, currently in use for the CRC 1625.\n                                          This ontology models the experimental (meta-)data, provenance and handover workflows present in MatInf instances, while additionally being compatible with existing Materials Science ontologies.\n                                          This additionally includes the modelling of handover workflow models, and other (meta-)data that is exclusively used by the MatInf semantic layer.\n                                          Note that some classes are not present in the ontology document. Namely, specific measurement types are dynamically generated, as they change between MatInf instances. Processes and activities for them, however, are included here." .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "CRC 1625 Ontology"@en .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#extends> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/2.0.8> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://schema.org/codeRepository> "https://github.com/DE-TUM/CRC1625"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0" .
