<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/assignedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assigned to object property is used to associate a user or project to a step in the handover workflow. Note that association does not imply authorship, for which the creator property exists.\n\nThis is used to associate Handover Groups to specific projects, and invididual Handovers to their corresponding receiver users." .
