<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/composedOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The composed of object property is used to indicate that a Materials Library or Sample is composed of other objects. These can be sample (pieces), treated samples (e.g. annealed samples) or any other kind of derivation that is registered in the RDMS as a separate object for better traceability." .
