<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/requiresActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates that the handover group that the Handover workflow model step is checking must contain a given activity within its handovers. The type of measurement is indicated by the targeted entity's class, by also belonging to one of the *Process classes (e.g. FIMProcess)" .
