# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/resource
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/resource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/resource> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentProperty> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/resource> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/ValueObject> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The resource object property is used to indicate that an uploaded file in the RDMS is related in some way to a given Materials library / Sample\n\nThis property does not explicitly indicate that the given file is generated *for* the object it is connected to; instead, it indicates that they are *related* in a generic way.\nTo indicate the former, the connection should instead be the other way around via the crc:characteristic property, as is in the majority of cases.\n             " .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Requires activity" .
