# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/substep
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/substep> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
