<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/allowIntermediateHandoverGroups> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates if the validation of the Handover workflow model allows intermediate, non-compliant handover groups on an otherwise valid handover group chain while validating. If true, the validation system will attempt to keep validating the current Handover workflow model step on the next handover group if the current handover group was non-compliant." .
