# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivity
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Process> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process that represents to the act of applying a measurement technique on an object in the CRC. Further specified by its subclasses.\n\nNote: Not to be confused with prov:Activity, which acts as the superclass of Process.\n\nAn entity of this class or any of its subclasses indicates the nature of its measurements by also belonging to one of the *Process classes (e.g. FIMProcess)" .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Characterization activity" .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityInstance
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityInstance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivity> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessInstance> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process that has as output a series of measurements of the same nature (e.g. EDX, TEM, FIM...) within the same handover of a sample in time, that results in one or more files being uploaded to the RDMS.\n\nThis is an additional abstraction that acts as a subordinate process of a handover, and has as outputs one or more measurements corresponding to the same type of measurement  (e.g., for EDX, EDX_raw and EDX_csv files)." .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Characterization activity instance" .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityModel
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityModel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivity> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessModel> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process indicating that a Handover workflow model step desires a set of measurements of the same time.\n\nAn entity of this type indicates the type of its measurements by belonging to a unidentifiable process class. This will be used by e.g. the Handover workflows validation system to correctly validate measurements assigned to handovers." .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/CharacterizationActivityModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Characterization activity model" .
# 
