# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/Handover
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/Handover> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/Handover> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdentifiableProcess> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/Handover> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process of handing an object (for now, samples) from one person to another. This represents the transfer of physical objects between members of the same or different projects within the CRC to perform different analysis." .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverGroup
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverGroup> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessInstance> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/UnidentifiableProcess> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abstraction that has as subordinate process a chain or one or more handovers that took place consecutively within the same CRC project (i.e., all destination users belong to the sam eproject)" .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Handover group" .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflow
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflow> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Process> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process composed of a series of processing steps as part of the work of the CRC, which involve the act of physically moving a sample to be studied to another person and/or project.\nIts subclasses narrow its application."@en .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Handover workflow" .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstance
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflow> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessInstance> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The beginning of a series of processes belonging to the same sample in the RDMS.\n\nAn instance of this entity will contain a three-layer hierarchy of consecutive HandoverGroup instances, each containing a series of consecutive Handover instances, which finally can contain Activity Instance entities with measurements as their outputs."@en .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Handover workflow instance"@en .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstanceAssignment
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstanceAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstanceAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessModel> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstanceAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/UnidentifiableProcess> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstanceAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process that indicates an assignment of one or more samples to a step in an entity of type HandoverWorkflowModel. A HandoverWorkflowModelInstance will contain one or more HandoverWorkflowInstanceAssignment instances to completely link a HandoverWorkflowModel to existing objects in the RDMS." .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowInstanceAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Handover workflow instance assignment" .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModel
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflow> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessModel> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The beginning of a series of processes that need to be performed.\n\n\nAn instance of this entity will contain a two-layer hierarchy of consecutive HandoverWorkflowModelStep instances that correspond to hypothetical handover groups of a given sample. Each step will contain zero or more Activity Model instances that dictate the desired measurements that the sample should contain, among other metadata, and that are taken at the time of any of the handovers within its corresponding handover group.\n\nNote that a Handover workflow Model instance dictates the processing steps, but are not linked to a specific samples - they instead act as templates that can be reused at will and assigned to different groups of samples. An entity of type HandoverWorkflowModelInstance will thus completely characterize a HandoverWorkflowModel by being able to apply it to existing objects in the RDMS during validation."@en .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Handover workflow model"@en .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelInstance
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelInstance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModel> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The beginning of a series of HandoverWorkflowModelStep instances. Each HandoverWorkflowModelStep instance indicates an assignment of one or more samples to a step in the same entity of type WorkflowModel.\n\n\nAn entity of this class will thus completely characterize a WorkflowModel by being able to apply it to existing objects in the RDMS during validation." .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Handover workflow model instance" .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelStep
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelStep> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessModel> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/UnidentifiableProcess> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A step in a Handover workflow model, with a set of attributes indicating its settings, and references to Activity Models and projects" .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/HandoverWorkflowModelStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Handover workflow model step" .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdeaOrExperimentPlan
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdeaOrExperimentPlan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdeaOrExperimentPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdentifiableProcess> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdeaOrExperimentPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An idea or experiment plan that may kickstart a Handover Workflow Model, requests for synthesis of samples and eventually a Handover Workflow Instance for one or more Materials Libraries"@en .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdeaOrExperimentPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Idea or experiment plan"@en .
# 
# https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdentifiableProcess
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdentifiableProcess> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdentifiableProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/ProcessInstance> .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdentifiableProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process that is identified by an ID in the RDMS" .
<https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/IdentifiableProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Identifiable process" .
# 
